<config toc=true toc-location=right toc-expand=1 toc-title="On this page" />

<section #sec:one | First section>

With `toc-location=right` the contents render as a sticky, scroll-aware sidebar on the
right — a "floating" contents that follows the reader. `toc-expand=1` expands the first
level initially; deeper levels start collapsed.

<sub-section | A subsection>

A nested heading — collapsed initially (`toc-expand=1`), expandable in place.

<section | Second section>

A second first-level heading.
